<title>SINGAPORE: Alliance Technology unit in China project.</title>
<headline>Alliance Technology unit in China project.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Technology and Development Ltd said its Oceanis Pte Ltd subsidiary has entered into an agreement with Hong Kong Cosmo Investment Ltd to provide aquarium works for Cosmo in China.</p>
<p>Alliance said the contract is valued at US$22 million and is likely to have a positive impact on earnings.</p>
<p>The statement gave no other details.</p>
</text>
